          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Reports of Independent Registered Public Accounting Firm"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          90.92970390625,
          138.39698688271608,
          12.454225723379636,
          15.659753858024601
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            255,
            255,
            255,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "40"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.34469068287035,
          229.40605671296294,
          355.84890596064815,
          17.22571026234573
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            255,
            255,
            255,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/FAEFJO+AGaramond-Bold",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "To the Board of Directors and Stockholders of MGM MIRAGE"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.34469068287035,
          271.6714888117284,
          805.2568579282407,
          15.659753858024601
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "We have audited management’s assessment, included in the accompanying “Management’s Annual Report on Internal Control Over Financial Reporting”, that MGM MIRAGE"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.3446550925926,
          290.6529702932098,
          760.8119800347222,
          15.659753858024715
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "(a Delaware corporation) and subsidiaries (the “Company”) maintained effective internal control over financial reporting as of December 31, 2004, based on criteria "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.34469068287035,
          309.63445177469134,
          797.7444620949074,
          15.659753858024715
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "established in Internal Control—Integrated Framework issued by the Committee of Sponsoring Organizations of the Treadway Commission. The Company’s management is"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.3446550925926,
          328.61593325617287,
          805.8030737847223,
          15.659753858024601
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "responsible for maintaining effective internal control over financial reporting and for its assessment of the effectiveness of internal control over financial reporting. Our respon-"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.3446195023148,
          347.5974147376543,
          806.3448645833333,
          15.659753858024715
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "sibility is to express an opinion on management’s assessment and an opinion on the effectiveness of the Company’s internal control over financial reporting based on our audit."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.3446195023148,
          385.5602353395062,
          784.4295341435185,
          15.659753858024601
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "We conducted our audit in accordance with the standards of the Public Company Accounting Oversight Board (United States). Those standards require that we plan and "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.34458391203702,
          404.54171682098763,
          795.9845347222222,
          15.659753858024715
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "perform the audit to obtain reasonable assurance about whether effective internal control over financial reporting was maintained in all material respects. Our audit included"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.34458391203702,
          423.52319830246915,
          793.8681825810186,
          15.659753858024601
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "obtaining an understanding of internal control over financial reporting, evaluating management’s assessment, testing and evaluating the design and operating effectiveness of"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.34453645833332,
          442.50467978395056,
          805.9033315972222,
          15.659753858024715
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "internal control, and performing such other procedures as we considered necessary in the circumstances. We believe that our audit provides a reasonable basis for our opinions."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.34453645833332,
          480.4675003858025,
          795.1110425347223,
          15.659753858024601
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "A company’s internal control over financial reporting is a process designed by, or under the supervision of, the company’s principal executive and principal financial officers, "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.34458391203702,
          499.4489818672839,
          790.0891001157407,
          15.659753858024715
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "or persons performing similar functions, and effected by the company’s board of directors, management, and other personnel to provide reasonable assurance regarding the "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.34453645833332,
          518.4304633487654,
          785.9388347800926,
          15.659753858024658
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "reliability of financial reporting and the preparation of financial statements for external purposes in accordance with generally accepted accounting principles. A company’s"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.34458391203702,
          537.411944830247,
          790.2777285879629,
          15.659753858024658
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "internal control over financial reporting includes those policies and procedures that (1) pertain to the maintenance of records that, in reasonable detail, accurately and fairly"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.34458391203702,
          556.3934263117284,
          779.8812983217592,
          15.659753858024658
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "reflect the transactions and dispositions of the assets of the company; (2) provide reasonable assurance that transactions are recorded as necessary to permit preparation of"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.34458391203702,
          575.3749077932099,
          794.9493796296296,
          15.659753858024658
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "financial statements in accordance with generally accepted accounting principles, and that receipts and expenditures of the company are being made only in accordance with"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.3446195023148,
          594.3563892746913,
          796.2935413773148,
          15.659753858024658
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "authorizations of management and directors of the company; and (3) provide reasonable assurance regarding prevention or timely detection of unauthorized acquisition, use,"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.34458391203702,
          613.3378707561728,
          452.4917190393518,
          15.6597380401235
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "or disposition of the company’s assets that could have a material effect on the financial statements."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.34458391203702,
          651.3007071759259,
          790.088589988426,
          15.659706404321014
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Because of the inherent limitations of internal control over financial reporting, including the possibility of collusion or improper management override of controls, material"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.34453645833332,
          670.2821886574075,
          783.5909085648148,
          15.659706404321014
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "misstatements due to error or fraud may not be prevented or detected on a timely basis. Also, projections of any evaluation of the effectiveness of the internal control over"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.34453645833332,
          689.2636701388889,
          793.6176863425925,
          15.659706404321014
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "financial reporting to future periods are subject to the risk that the controls may become inadequate because of changes in conditions, or that the degree of compliance with"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.34458391203702,
          708.2451516203704,
          195.23901041666664,
          15.659706404320957
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "the policies or procedures may deteriorate."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.34458391203702,
          746.2079722222222,
          769.0256585648149,
          15.659706404321014
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "In our opinion, management’s assessment that the Company maintained effective internal control over financial reporting as of December 31, 2004, is fairly stated, in "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.34458391203702,
          765.1894537037037,
          759.8765370370371,
          15.659706404321014
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "all material respects, based on criteria established in Internal Control—Integrated Framework issued by the Committee of Sponsoring Organizations of the Treadway"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.3446195023148,
          784.1709351851852,
          772.6782650462962,
          15.659706404320985
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Commission. Also in our opinion, the Company maintained, in all material respects, effective internal control over financial reporting as of December 31, 2004, based "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.34458391203702,
          803.1524166666667,
          700.1523258101852,
          15.659706404320985
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "on criteria established in Internal Control—Integrated Framework issued by the Committee of Sponsoring Organizations of the Treadway Commission."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.34458391203702,
          841.1152214506174,
          793.1560329861111,
          15.659706404320957
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "We have also audited, in accordance with the standards of the Public Company Accounting Oversight Board (United States), the consolidated financial statements as of and"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.34458391203702,
          860.0967029320988,
          730.5478703703703,
          15.659711149691361
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/EKLGOF+AGaramond-Regular",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "for the year ended December 31, 2004 of the Company and our report dated March 10, 2005 expressed an unqualified opinion on those financial statements."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.34469068287035,
          912.9924922839506,
          73.97840219907411,
          12.527780941358017
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            35,
            31,
            32,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/FAEFJO+AGaramond-Bold",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Las Vegas, Nevada"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          129.34469068287035,
          928.8103935185185,
          65.49938628472222,
          12.527780941358031
        ],
        "font": {
